WEBVTT

00:00:12.300 --> 00:00:19.500
NovaPay's web app calls four APIs through Tyk Gateway
Today the browser blocks every one

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:26.633
Fragments have their own screen in Tyk Dashboard
Each one is a named piece of shared API configuration

00:00:27.133 --> 00:00:35.900
The Fragment lists every API that uses it
Four APIs reference this one CORS policy

00:00:36.400 --> 00:00:51.267
Add the partner's origin to the Fragment
One edit, one save

00:00:51.767 --> 00:00:59.200
Same page, reloaded
All four APIs now accept NovaPay

00:00:59.700 --> 00:01:07.867
API teams see what is shared, and who sets it
The setting is read-only inside the API

00:01:08.367 --> 00:01:23.300
A change that would break the APIs
Tyk checks every API first and refuses the save

00:01:23.800 --> 00:01:28.700
Nothing was saved
The partner app still works

